OL,3,AGirl's death 'unexplained' after body
OL,4,Afound
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 11-year-old's death is being treated
OL,7,Fas unexplained by police who say they
OL,8,Fare investigating after her body was
OL,9,Ffound in a Worcestershire park.
OL,11,FThe girl was reported missing at about
OL,12,F23:20 BST on Sunday and she was later
OL,13,Ffound in the park near the cricket
OL,14,Fground in Elmley Castle, near Evesham,
OL,15,Fdetectives said.
OL,17,FInquiries were ongoing into the
OL,18,Fcircumstances surrounding her death, a
OL,19,FWest Mercia Police spokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
